en_US:
Pansage, Pansear, and Panpour are
Pokémon that evolve with special stones!{VAR BE01}
Which Pokémon do you want to evolve?

You might already know this, but I will
give you some advice!{VAR BE01}
When a Pokémon evolves, it will be more
powerful, but it will be slower to learn{VAR BE00}
a new move.{VAR BE01}
This is especially true for Pokémon that
evolve with stones.{VAR BE01}
So, it's up to you: you can have it learn
a good move and then evolve it with{VAR BE00}
a stone, or evolve it with a stone fast{VAR BE00}
and then have it learn a move with a TM!

Then, which Pokémon do you want
to evolve...{VAR BE01}
Pansage, Pansear, or Panpour?

Yes, that's true.{VAR BE01}
It's difficult to choose one.
When you decide, let me know!
